What are Automotive Aluminium Alloy Wheels?
Automotive aluminium alloy wheels are engineered components manufactured from specialized aluminium alloys, offering significant advantages over traditional steel wheels. These wheels provide superior heat dissipation, reduce unsprung vehicle weight by approximately 40%, and enhance handling characteristics. While their strength-to-weight ratio makes them ideal for passenger vehicles, ongoing material innovations are expanding their use in commercial applications.
